{"articleNo":"2906","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2906&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 일반대학원 석사과정 수업연한 단축 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.07.27","hit":"9389","attachments":[{"name":"일반대학원 석사과정 수업연한단축신청서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2906&attachNo=1707"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"393\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"85\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">2011-2학기 일반대학원 석사 과정</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;수업연한 단축 신청 안내</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"4\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;<font size=\"3\">2011-2학기 일반대학원 석사 과정생 수업연한 단축 신청에 관한&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp; 사항을 아래와 같이 공지하오니 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></span></font></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><br></p>\n<font size=\"3\"></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<font size=\"3\"></font></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 수업연한 단축 신청이란?</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;본교 학부 재학 중 대학원 과목을 사전 이수한 학부생이 대학원에 입학한 경우<br>대학원 석사과정 수료(또는 졸업)를 위한 수업연한을 6개월(1학기) 단축 할 수 있습니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 신청 대상자 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학부 재학 중 대학원 과목을 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6학점 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">사전이수한 자</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대학원 입학 후 사전 이수한 과목 6학점에 대하여 학점인정 받은 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 2011학년도 2학기 기준 3학기차가 되는자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;( ☞ 위 3가지 요건 모두 충족하여야 신청 가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제출기간 : 2011. 8. 1(월) ~ 8. 4(목)[4일간]</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 제출장소 : 각 학과 종합학사행정실</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 제출서류 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업연한단축신청서 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부 및 대학원 성적증명서 각 1부.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 유의사항 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학부 재학 중 사전 이수한 학점이 3학점인 학생은 수업연한 단축 불가</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수업연한 단축신청을 했다고 해서 무조건 3학기를 마치고 졸업(수료)하는 것이 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">아니라 졸업(수료)에 필요한 요건이 모두 갖추어져야 졸업(수료)이 가능함&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2011. 07.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원장&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&nbsp; </font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
